    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol., 1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> Prol., 1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="Prol., 1" corresp="#wit-b">Ðæt is ærest, þæt hi gecwædon, þæt hí ænne God lufian woldan ⁊ ælcne hæðendom georne aworpen.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="Prol., 1" corresp="#wit-h">Ðis [is] ærest, þæt hig gecwædon, þæt hí ænne God lufian woldon ⁊ ælcne hæþendom georne aworpen.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Prol., 1" corresp="#wit-q">Inprimis est, quod dixerunt, ut unum Deum diligere uelint et omni paganismo renunciare sedulo.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" n="§1" corresp="#wit-h">Ðæt is ærest, þæt hig gecwædon, þæt hí ænne God lufian woldon ⁊ ælcne hæþendom georne aworpen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">In the first place, they declared they would love one God, and zealously renounce all heathen practices.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Das ist [nämlich] erstens, dass sie bestimmten, dass sie Einen Gott lieben wollten und jedes Heidenthum eifrig abwerfen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">That is [namely] first, that they determined that they would love one God and zealously cast off all heathenism.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
